# E-Commerce Application

## Project Description

A collaborative E-Commerce Application developed using Git and GitHub.

## Features

- User Registration and Login
- Product Management
- Product Search
- Shopping Cart
- Order Management
- Payment Functionality
- Admin Dashboard

## Git Collaboration

The project uses Git branches for parallel development.

### Branches

- main
- development
- feature/auth
- feature/products
- feature/cart-orders
- feature/payment-admin